SUMMARY:West Art Presents: An Afternoon with Goodnight Moonshine feat. Moll
 y Venter of Red Molly\, with support from Old Sleepers
DESCRIPTION:West Art is thrilled to announce that Goodnight Moonshine is ta
 king over Sanctuary! They're no strangers to Lancaster\, and they're bring
 ing a captivating blend of folk\, jazz\, and Americana to West Art! Featur
 ing the soulful vocals of Molly Venter and the inventive guitar work of Eb
 en Pariser\, the duo delivers rich harmonies\, heartfelt songwriting\, and
  an intimate\, genre-bending sound. Opening the night is Olds Sleeper\, th
 e solo project of Heath James Hardin\, with songs derived from the landsca
 pes and people of rural Pennsylvania. Employing banjo\, resonator guitar\,
  acoustic guitar\, mandolin and ukelele\, Hardin writes songs that challen
 ge stereotypical country and folk styles! Join us for an intimate afternoo
 n of songs and stories under the stained glass!\n\nPrice: Not supplied by 
